            "description": "Get registrar retail first-year price estimates in USD for top-level domains (.com, .io, .app, .dev, .ai, …). Use this when the user is comparing TLD options, e.g. 'should I get the .com or the .io?'. For the exact purchase price of a specific domain, use check_domains instead.",
